/**
@page architecture Architecture

@image html static/architecture.png

@section core_packages Core Packages

@subsection snp_msgs snp_msgs

Contains ROS2 message and service definitions generating tool paths and motion plans.

@subsection snp_application snp_application

Contains a GUI application `Qt` widget, behavior tree plugins, and behavior tree configuration files

@subsection snp_tpp snp_tpp

Contains custom tool path planning GUI widgets and source code for the region of interest selection mesh modifier and SNP-specific raster tool path planner

@subsection snp_motion_planning snp_motion_planning

Contains a planning server based on `tesseract` for generating freespace and process motions; contains custom `tesseract` inverse kinematics plugins, planning task plugins, and planner profiles

@section simulation Simulation

@subsection snp_simulation snp_simulation

Contains scripts for to simulating robotic motion and surface reconstruction.
The motion simulator provides a `FollowJointTrajectory` action server that simply bypasses the execution of motion and returns success.
The surface reconstruction simulator returns a mesh that is loaded from a specified file.

*/
